<div class="content" id="zoom">
    <p style="line-height: 29pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-size: 24px;">面试总体安排</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">2026</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">年扬州市事业单位公开招聘工作人员面试</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">于</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">日、</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">日举行</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">。取得面试资格的考生，请在</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">日-</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">登录原报名网站</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">，完成</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">考试</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">缴费并自行打印纸质《面试通知书》。考生须严格按照面试通知书载明的要求参加面试</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt;"><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK;">出行及考前温馨提示</span></span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">面试期间城区道路交通流量较大，考点周边易发生拥堵。建议考生提前勘察路线、提前抵达考点，预留充足时间完成</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">入场核验</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">，避免迟到。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">所有送考车辆、随行人员一律不得进入考点校园内，不得在考点门口长时间聚集逗留，服从现场工作人员交通疏导与秩序管理。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">日为高考期间，部分道路可能进行</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">交通管制，建议考生优先选择公交、步行、非机动车等绿色出行方式。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">考生必须按照面试通知书规定的时间携带本人身份证原件</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">和</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">面试通知书到指定的候考室报到，截至当天上午</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">8:00</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">仍未签到者按缺考处理</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">，相关责任由考生本人自行承担。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 20pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-size: 24px;">全市面试考点</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><h3 style="line-height: 20pt;"><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（一）</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">扬州</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">市直考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p style="line-height: 20pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">江苏省扬州技师学院</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">邗江区职中路</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;">31</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/a6805de9d5dd478f8ad08086d1fdcd03.png"><img width="605" height="378" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/Sa6805de9d5dd478f8ad08086d1fdcd03-800.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">校内考场位置如下图：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/012faa998ac94d04819761c088687b9b.png"><img width="505" height="303" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/012faa998ac94d04819761c088687b9b.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p><p><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><h3><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（二）邗江区考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">邗江实验学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">邗江区百祥路</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;">63</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/9d19c4073db34a59bd109fb0400d6977.png"><img width="596" height="362" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/9d19c4073db34a59bd109fb0400d6977.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><h3><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（三）广陵区考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">扬州市</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">文峰小学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">文峰河路文峰小学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/9dfbf462127145cfb4f6399a527dd3cb.png"><img width="590" height="350" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/9dfbf462127145cfb4f6399a527dd3cb.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><h3><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（四）江都区考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">江都区第二中学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">（江</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">都区黄山路</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;">598</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/bed7ffd0db1f41eb88498159cdb62de7.png"><img width="597" height="369" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/bed7ffd0db1f41eb88498159cdb62de7.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><h3><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（五）仪征市考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">仪征技师学院</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">仪征市古运河路</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/4aaf1e3a3bef48a28a3b3cc197dee579.jpeg"><img width="588" height="350" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/4aaf1e3a3bef48a28a3b3cc197dee579.jpeg" /></a><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><h3><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（六）高邮市考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">高邮市汪曾祺学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">高邮市成贤路</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;">88</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/d491e45914984462b044a9434c715d25.png"><img width="591" height="377" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/d491e45914984462b044a9434c715d25.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><h3><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;">（七）宝应县考点</span><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14pt;"></span></h3><p><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">宝应县实验初级中学</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">白田路校区（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">宝应县白田中路</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;">59</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/f1b4724370d6498d8a83440eb26160ab.png"><img width="588" height="343" src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20266/f1b4724370d6498d8a83440eb26160ab.png" /></a><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p><p><span style="font-family: 等线; font-size: 11pt;"><br /></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正黑体_GBK;">考场纪律及考生须知</span></strong></span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">各位考生须认真阅读</span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">面试通知书</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">，确认面试时间，做好考前准备，知晓相关规定，遵守考场规则。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">证件要求：考生入场必须全程携带</span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">本人有效居民身份证原件、纸质面试通知书</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">，两证齐全方可入场</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">时间要求：考生须严格按照</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">面试通知书上</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">规定时间进入</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">指定的</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">候考室</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">报</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">到</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">，截至当天上午</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">8:00</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">仍未签到的，按缺考处理。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">设备管理：</span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">所有考生</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">严禁携带任何通讯工具和电子产品（设备）</span></strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">进入候考（备考）室，已带入候考室的必须在组织抽签前主动上交给工作人员集中保管。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">面试规范：面试的</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">抽签顺序号是考生在面试过程中的身份标识，严禁考生交换或撕毁抽签顺序号。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">面试全程不得以任何方式透露本人姓名、工作单位等个人信息</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p style="line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">着装要求：考生不得穿着带有特殊职业标志的制式服装</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">和配饰</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GBK; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p><p><br style="white-space: normal;" /></p><p><br /></p>
